# With the balance check summing into a bigint, an entry that nets past bigint
# raises 22003 instead of LB001, and the client is told nothing it can act on.

title: an entry that nets past bigint is refused for the wrong reason
file: internal/schema/0001_ledger.sql
run: make db-reset && go test -count=1 -run TestAnEntryWhoseLegsSumPastBigintIsRefusedForNotBalancing -v ./internal/schema/
--- before
    net  numeric;
--- after
    -- negative control: the net is capped at the width of one posting
    net  bigint;
